ng Girls", "english": "Iwakakeru -Sport Climbing Girls-"}, "format": "TV", "description": "The story centers around girls who compete in sport climbing, particularly climbing artificially constructed walls. First-year high school student Konomi Kasahara discovered this sport at Hanamiya Girls' High School after training her mind with puzzle games during junior high school.<br>\n<br>\n(Source: Anime News Network)", "startDate": {"year": 2020, "month": 10}, "endDate": {"year": 2020, "month": 12}, "season": "FALL", "seasonYear": 2020, "episodes": 12, "duration": 24, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "MANGA", "hashtag": "#いわかける", "genres": ["Comedy", "Drama", "Sports"], "tags": [{"name": "School Club", "rank": 97, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Athletics", "rank": 96, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Female Protagonist", "rank": 90, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Primarily Female Cast", "rank": 84, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Fitness", "rank": 83, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Mountaineering", "rank": 73, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Tsundere", "rank": 66, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "School", "rank": 62, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Seinen", "rank": 60, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Tomboy", "rank": 55, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Educational", "rank": 44, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Video Games", "rank": 10, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 117758, "title": {"romaji": "Soukyuu no Fafner: Dead Aggressor - THE BEYOND Part 3", "english": "Fafner THE BEYOND Part 3"}, "format": "MOVIE", "description": "Episodes 7-9 of the Soukyuu no Fafner: Dead Aggressor - The Beyond series.", "startDate": {"year": 2020, "month": 11}, "endDate": {"year": 2020, "month": 11}, "season": "FALL", "seasonYear": 2020, "episodes": 3, "duration": 30, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": "#fafner", "genres": ["Drama", "Mecha", "Sci-Fi"], "tags": [{"name": "Aliens", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Tragedy", "rank": 60, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Reincarnation", "rank": 60, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Post-Apocalyptic", "rank": 60, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Military", "rank": 60, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Ensemble Cast", "rank": 60, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Kuudere", "rank": 30, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 117913, "title": {"romaji": "Tokyo Autumn Session", "english": null}, "format": "MUSIC", "description": "What does it mean to become an adult? While it may seem like it brings freedom, the transition into adulthood can also create a gap between loved ones. For the teenagers who once laughed together, work, distance, and responsibilities widen the rift between them. Reminiscence reminds them of the joy-filled times when they were more carefree, and even now, through thick and thin, their love perseveres.<br></br>\n", "startDate": {"year": 2020, "month": 1}, "endDate": {"year": 2020, "month": 1}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 1, "duration": 6, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": null, "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Romance", "Slice of Life"], "tags": [{"name": "Coming of Age", "rank": 100, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Heterosexual", "rank": 80, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Urban", "rank": 75, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Time Skip", "rank": 50, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Male Protagonist", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 118036, "title": {"romaji": "Gon", "english": null}, "format": "MOVIE", "description": "A short film based on Niimi Nankichi's masterpiece, \"Gon, the Little Fox\", with a new story added based on an original interpretation.\nThe film depicts the existence of barriers that man and beast cannot overcome. The stage is natural woodland close to a vllage in Japan, which is home to many small lives. This sad, yet gentle tale that unfolds in the beauty of nature.", "startDate": {"year": 2020, "month": 2}, "endDate": {"year": 2020, "month": 2}, "season": "WINTER", "seasonYear": 2020, "episodes": 1, "duration": 28, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "OTHER", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Adventure